Platform Features

1. Personalized Challenges

Users can choose a personal growth goal and begin a structured 90-day journey.

2. Daily Missions

Daily tasks designed to encourage consistency and measurable progress.

3. Habit Tracking

Users can track daily habits and monitor their consistency over time.

4. Progress Dashboard

A visual dashboard showing completed days, milestones, and overall progress.

5. Daily Journaling

A private space for users to reflect on their experiences, thoughts, and improvements.

6. Achievement System

Milestones and achievements that recognize users' progress.

7. Accountability

Features designed to encourage users to stay committed throughout their 90-day journey.

8. Completion Summary

A final report showing the user's progress and achievements after completing a challenge.

Status

All features are currently planned and subject to refinement during development.
